> [@gdl-reif](https://github.com/gdl-reif) [@kunzaatko](https://github.com/kunzaatko) to fix that error you need to reduce the output for that model like so.
> 
>         "kimi-k2.5": {
>           "id": "Kimi-K2.5",
>           "limit": {
>             "output": 10000, // Reduce limit.output for models where you get rate-limit errors
>             "context": 262144
>           }
>         }

I can confirm that this works on my machine... Thank you!

